{"id": "americas-cup-host-costs-and-back-wages", "title": "The America’s Cup wage checks and San Francisco’s $11.5 million hosting cost", "seconds": 69.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "17a7a4fee3a382b4", "words": 205, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco’s America’s Cup deal mentioned thirty-two million dollars twice. Who was protected?", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.54, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$32 million", "label": "America’s Cup host agreement · two clauses"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.88, 1.33, 1.58, 1.81, 2.26, 2.71, 2.98, 3.27, 4.07, 4.25, 4.37]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "One clause protected the Event Authority. The other set a fundraising target for the City.", "t0": 5.54, "t1": 9.98, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "2010 host agreement", "heading": "Two promises, different beneficiaries", "source": "venue", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Section 9.3 · security", "value": "Event Authority"}, {"icon": "transfer", "label": "Section 9.4 · fundraising", "value": "City hosting costs"}]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.27, 0.55, 0.96, 1.07, 1.34, 2.37, 2.57, 2.82, 2.99, 3.05, 3.52, 3.84, 3.96, 4.07]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Private organizers promised to try to raise the money. They never guaranteed the City’s costs.", "t0": 10.1, "t1": 14.62, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "venue", "kicker": "Host agreement · section 9.4", "text": "Private fundraising targets", "mark": "Private fundraising targets"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.97, 1.37, 1.48, 1.69, 1.78, 1.99, 2.09, 2.7, 2.89, 3.13, 3.54, 3.64, 3.94]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The forecast assumed fifteen racing syndicates. Only four came.", "t0": 14.74, "t1": 18.02, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "flow", "context": "The economic projection", "heading": "How many racing syndicates?", "source": "analyst", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "2010 projection", "value": "15 syndicates"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Syndicates participating", "value": "4 syndicates"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.66, 1.0, 1.43, 1.75, 2.41, 2.7, 2.96]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Estimated local economic activity reached about a quarter of the original projection.", "t0": 18.14, "t1": 22.55, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Businesses and residents", "heading": "Estimated local economic activity", "source": "analyst", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Original projection", "value": "$1.372 billion"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "December 2013 estimate", "value": "$364.4 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.6, 0.95, 1.41, 2.07, 2.37, 2.57, 2.66, 3.05, 3.13, 3.25, 3.61]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Including the accelerated cruise terminal put the Mayor’s economic estimate higher.", "t0": 22.67, "t1": 26.25, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "mayor", "kicker": "Mayor’s response · September 2014", "text": "Cruise terminal construction", "mark": "Cruise terminal construction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.54, 1.09, 1.39, 1.77, 1.92, 2.02, 2.32, 2.82, 3.2]}, {"scene": "f", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The General Fund spent about twenty and a half million dollars, including a transfer to the Port.", "t0": 26.47, "t1": 30.91, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$20,466,389", "label": "General Fund expenditures · includes Port reimbursement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.42, 0.69, 0.92, 1.13, 1.39, 1.49, 1.57, 1.79, 2.1, 2.84, 3.29, 3.36, 3.82, 3.91, 4.02]}, {"scene": "f", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Private fundraising and estimated event taxes brought back nearly fourteen and a half million.", "t0": 31.03, "t1": 35.04, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "flow", "context": "General Fund", "heading": "What came back to the City", "source": "analyst", "rows": [{"icon": "transfer", "label": "Private reimbursement", "value": "$8,674,387"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Estimated event taxes", "value": "$5,793,484"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.77, 0.9, 1.37, 1.64, 2.1, 2.37, 2.64, 2.94, 3.29, 3.38, 3.44, 3.64]}, {"scene": "f", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Add the Port’s separate net costs, and the public bill was eleven and a half million dollars.", "t0": 35.16, "t1": 39.28, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "After reimbursements", "heading": "Net public cost", "source": "analyst", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "General Fund", "value": "$5,998,518"}, {"icon": "port", "label": "Net Port costs", "value": "$5,461,386"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.33, 0.76, 1.11, 1.29, 1.8, 1.98, 2.07, 2.36, 2.57, 2.73, 2.99, 3.08, 3.15, 3.33, 3.6]}, {"scene": "f", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Board acknowledged that cost and cited infrastructure and wider economic benefits.", "t0": 39.4, "t1": 43.36, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "response", "kicker": "Board of Supervisors · finding 8", "text": "Economic and infrastructure benefits", "mark": "Economic and infrastructure benefits"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.35, 0.86, 1.04, 1.45, 1.58, 1.9, 2.53, 2.65, 2.94, 3.35]}, {"scene": "w", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Meanwhile, union complaints led City investigators to audit the temporary installation crews.", "t0": 43.58, "t1": 48.35, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Private venue leases", "heading": "Who enforced the wage terms?", "source": "analyst", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Temporary installation", "value": "Lease commitment"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Union complaints", "value": "City labor audits"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.81, 1.06, 1.56, 1.77, 2.0, 2.65, 2.78, 3.05, 3.15, 3.63, 4.22]}, {"scene": "w", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Nine contractors and subcontractors were assessed.", "t0": 48.47, "t1": 51.4, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "analyst", "kicker": "Office of Labor Standards Enforcement", "text": "Contractor and subcontractor assessments", "mark": "Contractor and subcontractor assessments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.99, 1.1, 1.88, 2.01]}, {"scene": "w", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Event Authority paid the City $406,566.", "t0": 51.4, "t1": 56.12, "shot": "r11b", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$406,566", "label": "Nine contractor and subcontractor assessments"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.47, 0.89, 1.1, 1.2, 1.54, 1.78, 2.06, 2.29, 3.08, 3.36, 3.62, 4.19]}, {"scene": "w", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "By February 2014, 74 of the 120 workers had received back wages.", "t0": 56.24, "t1": 61.05, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "flow", "context": "Controller’s payments", "heading": "What happened to the wage money?", "source": "analyst", "rows": [{"icon": "transfer", "label": "Received back wages", "value": "74 employees"}, {"icon": "search", "label": "Still being located", "value": "46 employees"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.52, 0.77, 1.37, 2.05, 2.16, 2.3, 2.5, 2.73, 3.01, 3.56, 3.74, 4.05, 4.28]}, {"scene": "w", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Investigators were looking for the other forty-six. The final payment reconciliation is still missing.", "t0": 61.17, "t1": 66.1, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "analyst", "kicker": "February 2014 · table 12", "text": "Controller disbursements", "mark": "Controller disbursements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.7, 0.83, 1.1, 1.2, 1.33, 1.58, 2.7, 2.86, 3.14, 3.44, 4.2, 4.29, 4.51]}, {"scene": "w", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 66.22, "t1": 68.36, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Two different promises", "f": "The public bill", "w": "The wage checks"}, "look": "map", "hook": "number"}